# Corner geometry

Use [`lib/core/config/theme/app_shape.dart`](../../lib/core/config/theme/app_shape.dart) — **no ad-hoc `BorderRadius.circular` on product cards, fields, dialogs, or rounded buttons** unless migrating that widget in the same change.

## Default — superellipse

Flutter **3.41+** native API:

```dart
RoundedSuperellipseBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(r))
```

via `AppShape.superellipse(radius: r)`.

`AppCard` clips children to this shape (accent stripes, gradients, and shadows share one silhouette).

## Owner-approved exceptions (not superellipse)

| Surface | Shape |
|---------|--------|
| Shell nav pill | `StadiumBorder` / `AppShape.stadium` |
| Selected nav tab overlay | Half-height stadium (`radius = height / 2`) |
| Voucher `+` satellite, true avatars marked circular | `CircleBorder` / `AppShape.circle` |

## Migration

Unmigrated screens may still use `BorderRadius.circular` until touched. Do **not** mass-rewrite every screen in one pass.
